CONTEXT SAAT KEPUTUSAN

- Tahap funding: Strategic round Paradigm + Standard Crypto Nov 2023 (~$20M–$30M media reports)【Phase 5 — Funding History】; Foundation treasury opacity, no revenue data【Phase 5 — Treasury, Revenue History】
- Ukuran komunitas: >500k address pre-mainnet (Season 1 bridge depositors)【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】; Blur user base ~hundreds of thousands traders【Phase 7 — Major Integrations Blur】
- Kondisi pasar: L2 wars 2023-2024 (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, zkSync, Linea, Mantle)【Phase 8 — Competitor Landscape】; Points meta trend (LayerZero, zkSync, Linea, Scroll, EigenLayer points programs 2023-2024)【Phase 8 — Narrative Position】; Bear market tail 2023 → early bull 2024
- Kompetitor terdekat: Arbitrum (ARB airdrop Mar 2023, 12,75% supply), Optimism (OP airdrop May 2022, 19% supply first round), zkSync (ZK airdrop Jun 2024, 17,5% supply) — Blast menggunakan points-based bukan retroactive snapshot murni【Phase 8 — Competitor Landscape】

TRIGGER DAN ALTERNATIF

Trigger: Perlu bootstrap liquidity dan user base pre-mainnet tanpa public token sale; native yield feature butuh TVL untuk meaningful yield distribution; Blur integration memberikan saluran akuisisi user siap pakai【Phase 9 — Decision Timeline EV-002, EV-005】【Phase 9 — Strategic Objectives】
